# shadcn/ui components (`frontend/src/components/ui/`)

Generated and hand-maintained [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) primitives for the v2 SPA.

## Conventions

- **Tailwind utilities** are allowed here (and in `components/dashboard/`).
- Theme colors come from **Excelsior tokens** via `shadcn-theme.css` — do not hardcode zinc/slate hex values.
- Radix portal z-index is capped below global nav (`--z-nav: 9999`) in `tailwind.css`.
- Prefer **Lucide** icons in new shadcn components; existing screens may keep `icons.tsx`.

## Adding components

From `frontend/`:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button
```

If the CLI fails validation, copy the component from [ui.shadcn.com](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) and align imports with `@/lib/utils`.

Full setup: [`docs/current/SHADCN_UI.md`](../../../../docs/current/SHADCN_UI.md).
